$MEM-GC

// Demonstrates the syntax for declaring a custom operator in TeapotLang.
// - `operator` keyword followed by the operator symbol (e.g. `+`)
// - a comma-separated, typed multi-argument parameter list (same style as `fc`)
// - an explicit return type after `!`
// - a body that computes and returns a value via `exit`
//
// Note: this only demonstrates declaration syntax.
// Operator overload resolution is out of scope for this example.

pub operator +(csi32 a, csi32 b)!csi32 {
    exit a + b.
}